Tag Studio sheet fonts
======================

Bundled copies of @vexflow-fonts packages (OFL-1.1), used for on-screen
engraving and PDF/image export without a CDN dependency at runtime.

Sources (jsDelivr / npm @vexflow-fonts/*):
  Bravura, Petaluma, Petaluma Text, Petaluma Script — Steinberg Media (OFL)
  Leland, Leland Text — MuseScore (OFL)
  Finale Maestro / Finale Maestro Text — MakeMusic (via @vexflow-fonts)
  Academico — @vexflow-fonts
  Roboto Slab — Google Fonts (Apache 2.0), packaged by @vexflow-fonts

Layout mirrors VexFlow `Font.FILES` paths under this directory so
`Font.HOST_URL` can point here. Each face includes `.woff2` (screen / raster
embed) and `.otf` (vector PDF glyph outlining via opentype.js).

Refresh:
  ./web/scripts/fetch-sheet-fonts.sh
